  "description": "*“So, would you like me to check your breasts?”*\n\nYun-Hui, who was diagnosed with breast cancer at the young age of twenty-eight. Despairing over the unexpected diagnosis, Yun-Hui drank more than usual and mistook a suspicious-looking man passing by for a molester.\n\n *“Want me to check it for you? I’m a pro at that.”\n\n‘What the hell is this pervert saying?!’* She gave the man—who looked perfectly normal but was clearly a pervert—a bloody beating and stormed off… only to run into him again in the most unexpected place…! What kind of crappy fate is this?\n\n *“I told you, touching is my specialty.”\n\n“I’ll take responsibility for you, Sa Yun-Hui.”*\n\nAfter that disastrous first meeting, will they actually manage to finish the XX construction project without incident?\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
